- Both build configs clean; valid BPF ELF (5 maps); F6 rejects unauthorized fetch (no bypass); sync-fetch validates proofs; graceful degradation guaranteed by the type system; ebpf 168 + blockmatrix blockchain+network 395 + security::ebpf 20, 0 fail, 0 weakened; P1/P2/F2 intact.
